## 1. Category accuracy (hentai random videos) ✅ — asli root cause mila

Maine live probed to pata chala **xhamster ka apna `/categories/hentai` page hi galat hai**: uska SSR payload ab sirf ek **personalized trending cube** bhejta hai — 46 cards me se sirf ~37% hentai hote hain, baaki "She got pregnant with him", desi MILF jaise random videos. Real grid to client-side pe render hota hai jo scraping ke liye useless hai.

**Fix (server.js me):**
