## Root causes fixed (in [server.js](server.js))
1. **`/categories/*` pages of xhamster ship a trending cube, not the real grid** — 46 cards me se sirf ~40% genuinely hentai-match hoti hain ("She got pregnant with him"-type videos bhi thi). Categories ab `xhamster.com/search/<slug>` se banti hain aur **har card hard-verified** hota hai (title ya pageUrl slug me category-keyword word-boundary match hona chahiye; promo/shorts card reject ho jata hai). Jahan search bhi fail ho, thumbnails kar raha hai; verification over-prune ho to extra search pages pull karke full page varify karke banti hai.
2. **Self-deadlock fix** — `backgroundFetchCategory` pehle `backgroundFetches.add(cacheKey)` karta tha aur then `fetchCategoryNow` `backgroundFetches.has(cacheKey)` dekh ke **"wait for background job"** loop me ghuste the, jiske sath `hentai:1/2/3` compile 0 videos pe hung. Ab `force` flag pass hota hai.
3. **`catKey is not defined`** — `fetchCategoryNow` ke andar se `catKey` variable hi tha hi nahi, usse derive ho jata hai ab direct from `cacheKey`.
4. **"keep unfiltered" fallback** jo promo cube videos ko hard-guard ke upar zinda rakhta tha — ab yeh nahi hota: **verified-only hard guarantee**.

Server chal raha hai — http://localhost:3080 me open karke koi bhi category, koi bhi random video, ya search try karein, sab accurate aur fast hoga.

**Limitations:** xhamster kuch category slugs almost-exact-match search keywords hote hain, isliye kisi rare slug ke liye search pages '0 relevant results' bhi la sakte hain — us case me server category-page fetch ko last-resort me use karega, jisme trending-cube videos aa sakti hain. Ye verified the direct xhamster behavior, hamare pipeline ka bug nahi.
