3. **`catKey is not defined`** — `fetchCategoryNow` ke andar se `catKey` variable hi tha hi nahi, usse derive ho jata hai ab direct from `cacheKey`.
4. **"keep unfiltered" fallback** jo promo cube videos ko hard-guard ke upar zinda rakhta tha — ab yeh nahi hota: **verified-only hard guarantee**.

Server chal raha hai — http://localhost:3080 me open karke koi bhi category, koi bhi random video, ya search try karein, sab accurate aur fast hoga.

