## Bug kya tha

Mere pichhle accuracy-purge ko [loadCachesFromDisk](server.js#L172) me daal diya tha, lekin purge ke andar jo verification chalti hai uski dependency (`catVariantsCache`) line 1445 pe declare hoti hai — load line 216 pe hota hai. Ye **TDZ ReferenceError** deta hai jo `catch {/* ignore */}` chupchap nigal jaata tha. Result: **har server start pe poora disk-cache silently gayab** → `[Seed] Serving 0 cached pages` → har page aur har category network se cold fetch (3–8s), streams bhi bar-bar naye se resolve. Isiliye "sab kuch slow" lag raha tha — actual fetch machinery theek thi, sirf cache har baar replace and rebuild ho raha tha.

## Fixes (in [server.js](server.js))

1. **Purge cot load se nikaala** — ab ek alag function jo module poora load hone ke baad chalta hai; koi silent failure nahi
