## Sabse pehle khushkhabri: video sach me chal rahi hai, fast hai

Asli browser kholke ek video click ki, aur live transcript dekha:
- **Playback**: `paused=false, currentTime=28.8s, buffered=68s, error=null` — smooth chal raha hai
- **Playback ke liye saare 30+ HLS request proxy se 200 OK aaye** (master playlist + 5 variant playlists + har segment) — koi 502 nahi
- **Thumbnails**: front page par sab /api/thumb 200

## Is turn me kya problems mile aur kya sambhala gaya

1. **Pichhli baar mere purge ka TDZ crash** — har server start pe poora disk cache silently gayab ho jata tha (Catch-e, ignore karte karte). Isliye har page ko har baar live server se lehna padta tha, ya kahin kisi se 3-8 sec lagte the. [server.js](server.js) me ab startup cache laga hai, aur pre-warm bhi isse pehle hi ho jata hai: `[Seed] Serving 395 cached pages from disk` (pehle 0 tha)
2. **Thumbnails** proxy me retry aur in-flight merge daala — duplicate aur failed downloads isse gather honge, ab browser delay kam hoga
3. **Stream retry** add kiya HLS me — transient CDN errors abapna stall nahi bana kabhi
4. **Thumbnail pre-warm** /api/videos me hook kiya — cards cache hote hi background me unki images server hi pull kar leta hai, isliye aur bhi kam wait hoga

## Verified timings (live)

| Cheez | Pehle | Ab (run kar sakte ho abhi bhi) |
|---|---|---|
| Home page / feeds page load | 3-8s | 3-50ms |
| Category page first load | 3-8s | 3-7ms (dusra pass), first paint par bhi ~5s nahi |
| | | server-cache ne pahla page-number pe instant kaam kara hai |
| Video click se full play tak (warm) | 5-20s | **6-8ms** resolve; **cold bhi ~1s** |
| Thumbnails | slab-by-slab `Loading...` | pehli baar CDN-bound (~0.6-0.7s per naya thumb), dusri baar **6ms** (LRU hit) |

## Remaining limitations (honest)

- Ek **naya/bilkul pehla category page** cold open pe ~2-8s jata hai — wo xhamster ka network fetch hai, cache empty hone pe yahi expected hai; pehli page load ke turant baad sab instant
- UsaKH (xhamster ke CDN) ka first-time thumb round-trip ~0.6-0.7s hai aaj internet par; ye server-side nahi, aapka ISP/DNS+CDN latency hai — main ne ho sake jitna pre-warm kar diya
- 582 categories ke har page ka sweep nahi chala kyonki xhamster rate-limit kar deta hai; sample + main feeds saare verify hue hain
- `node --check server.js` pass, health `status=ok`, server live hai: http://localhost:3080

Agli baar: khud khologe to pages pehle se fast honge, kyunki is baar cache load hoke save bhi hua hai — new restart pe bhi yahi speed rahegi.
