Sab kuch fix ho gaya hai — final report Hinglish mein:

**Kya slow tha:** cold videos par stream resolve ~19s leta tha, aur player 144p se start hota tha. Warm path par pehle se fixes laga chuke the.

**Ab browser-me verified, fresh click:**

| Check | Result |
|---|---|
| Thumbnails | 0 broken, 36/36 load ho gaye viewport on-scroll (rest lazy-load) ✅ |
| Player start | Click→play sirf **~0.5–2s** ✅ |
| Startup quality |ပहla frame **720p par pin** hai, phir ABR khud 1080p chadh gaya ✅ |
| Wide video check | 1080p par live play hua (window.hls ABR climb ✅) |
| Portrait video check | Native max res (720×960) par play hua ✅ |
