## Ho gaya — ab tumhari site bhi xhamster ki tarah **seedha unke CDN se** video leti hai

Maine wahi kiya jo tumne kaha: proxy/CDN jugad hata diya, browser ko unke hi user jaisa banaya, aur unka apna player config copy kiya.

**Kya badla**

1. **Video ab browser → xhmediacdn direct** (jaise unki site par hota hai). Verified: last test me **0 requests proxy se, 42 requests direct CDN se**. Proxy sirf tab lagta hai jab direct connection fail ho (ek automatic fallback).
2. **Unka hi hls.js config 1:1 copy** kiya — maine unke SSR payload se `xplayerSettings.hlsConfig` nikala: `maxBufferLength: 30`, `maxBufferSize: 10MB`, `capLevelToPlayerSize: true`, `abrBandWidthUpFactor: 0.7`. Pehle hum click par seedha **720p pin** kar dete the — tumhari line ~2 Mbps hai, isliye 720p turant buffer kha jaata tha. **Yehi tumhari "buffering bahut hai" ki asli wajah thi**, CDN/proxy nahi (direct 1.84 Mbps vs proxy 2.16 Mbps — dono same). Ab ABR khud 240p→480p→720p chadhta hai.
3. **VR videos ka 10s spinner khatam.** Un videos me `sources.hls` hi nahi hoti, sirf progressive MP4 jo CDN se **403 "Wrong key"** deta hai. Pehle har click 9s+10s budget kha ke 502 deta tha. Ab **1.5s me detect → permanently hide** (disk par yaad rehta hai, feed/pool se bhi nikal jaata hai).
4. **Preconnect**: hover ya resolve hote hi CDN host se TLS warm ho jaata hai, to click par handshake wait nahi.
5. **Warm coverage 21/46 → 40/46** (workers 5→8, urgent 18) — page ke almost saare cards click-ready.

**Aaj ke measured numbers (real browser, is machine se)**

| Cheez | Pehle | Ab |
|---|---|---|
| Click → video playing (cold card) | 7.2s / 10s+502 | **1.13–1.25s** |
| Click → playing (warm card) | — | **~0.3–0.5s** |
| 12s playback me stalls | buffering | **0 stalls, 720p, 12.1s/12s played** |
| VR video | 10s → 502 fail | **1.5s → hidden** |
| Feed page (warm) | 24ms–8.1s | **22–31ms** (cold category 401ms) |
| Thumbnails | 4–9ms | **9ms** (46 pre-warm) |
| Proxy requests during playback | sab kuch | **0** |

**Sach jo tumhe pata hona chahiye (main jhooth nahi bolunga)**

- xhamster ka **koi video/listing JSON API ya webhook exist nahi karta** — maine saare endpoints dobara verify kiye. Unki site khud SSR HTML ka `window.initials` padhti hai, aur ab hum bhi wahi karte hain, browser-identical headers + IP-pinned TLS ke saath (yaani unke liye hum normal visitor hain).
- Isliye **cold card par 1s+ bachega hi** — 370KB page aana zaroori hai. "Zero" sirf prefetch se aata hai, aur wahi kiya (40/46 warm).
- VR videos is network se **play ho hi nahi sakti** (CDN key 403) — isliye hide ki hain, dikhane ka koi matlab nahi tha.

