[services/xh-core.js](services/xh-core.js) — direct DoH-pinned fetch (relay sirf emergency fallback), `window.initials` parser: listing cards (46/page, views + created + duration + trailer + sprite), pagination (teeno shapes: feed/category `paginationProps`, search `?page=` wala `pagination`), video page se metadata + hex-decrypted m3u8 + related videos + tags.

