[services/xh-data.js](services/xh-data.js) — on-demand layer: ek request = ek upstream page. Sirf short TTL memoisation (listing 3 min, watch 15 min) + single-flight dedupe. Koi warm queue, koi pool, koi background job nahi.

[server.js](server.js) — 2419 → 364 lines. Warm queue, stream pool, `ensurePageFresh`, cron refresh, disk pools, `/api/warm`, `/api/batch-pages`, hover/next-page preload — sab hata diya. Bacha: thumb proxy (LRU + keep-alive + host swap), HLS proxy (playlist rewrite), aur on-demand API.

**Ab gestures bhi xhamster jaisi hain** — click = navigation, real URL:

| Route | Kaam |
|---|---|
| `/` | 3 rows (Trending today / Newest / Best of week), har row apne aane par render |
| `/newest`, `/best/daily`, `/best/weekly`, `/best/monthly`, `/most-viewed` | feeds + chips + pager |
| `/categories/<slug>/<page>` | 582 categories, sidebar grouped |
| `/search/<q>/<page>` | live suggest dropdown (`/api/front/search/suggest`) + results |
| `/videos/<slug>` | player + title + views/date/duration/author + tags + related |

**Click par ek hi upstream fetch** stream, title, tags, category, author aur related — sab deta hai. Player hls.js on-demand load karta hai (library API ke saath parallel), `/api/stream` se playlists/segments proxy hote hain.

