Ab upstream tak pahunchne wale requests ek token bucket se guzarte hain: **max 4 connections, max 6 page-fetch/second**. User click queue me aage aata hai, par burst nahi kar sakta. Pehle 1000 users = 1000 requests ek saath → wahi cheez 2-minute cooldown trigger karti thi.

**2. Browser jaisa behaviour.** Wahi file.
Chrome 125 ke 11 headers (`sec-ch-ua`, `sec-fetch-*`, `upgrade-insecure-requests`…), **cookie jar** (age-gate/consent/session cookies carry hote hain — har request naya client nahi lagta), aur asli `gzip, deflate, br` + decompression. Bare `User-Agent` + 2 headers sabse sasta bot-tell tha; ab wo nahi hai.

